<title>THAILAND: Thai central bank schedule for Feb notes auction.</title>
<headline>Thai central bank schedule for Feb notes auction.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Tuesday it has scheduled weekly auctions in February for a total of 12 billion baht ($461.5 million) in short-term central bank notes. The following is the auction schedule:</p>
<p>Bank of Thailand note auctions:</p>
<p>    Date	   Maturity (Days)	    Amount</p>
<p>					     (million baht)</p>
<p>    7/2/97	   28			2,000</p>
<p>    7/2/97	   85			1,000</p>
<p>    7/2/97	  175			1,000</p>
<p>   14/2/97	   28			2,000</p>
<p>   14/2/97	  364			1,000</p>
<p>   20/2/97	   28			2,000</p>
<p>   20/2/97	   84			1,000</p>
<p>   28/2/97	   28			2,000</p>
<p>(US$1  =  26 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
